        "abstract": "Two main situations are analysed by studying analytically and numerically the time dependent coherent three-wave equations for SBS with periodic pump pulse input: (1) coherent where the solitons have the same phase; and (2) random where the phase of each soliton changes randomly with respect to that of the neighbouring solitons. For a train of well separated solitons, the SBS thresholds range from P/sub thr/ approximately=1 mW at f/sub bit/ approximately=0.7 GHz for the coherent phase to P/sub thr/ approximately=860 mW at f/sub bit/ approximately=20 GHz for the random phase.<<ETX xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">&gt;</ETX>",
